Help                                                ●
Reads the messenger's radio from
~/.config/mesh/config.json; never writes it.
Holding Tab 3 s locks meshflash: every key is then
ignored but the unlock (any key wakes the screen,
then Tab, then Enter), and a flash or setup carries
on. Nothing locks by itself. Holding Esc 3 s still
ends meshflash, locked or not (the launcher does
that): a flash or setup under way stops the safe way,
and screen.log says what the board is left with.
Serial ports need the dialout group. Run these once:
sudo usermod -aG dialout void
sudo reboot
j/k scroll  space page  any other key back